From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:15:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Post-game rewards and the Trainer Tower Lv. 50 rule (R17)

- Trainer Tower: your Pokemon above Lv. 50 battle as Lv. 50 and get their
  real level back afterwards; opponents are Lv. 50.
- A Trainer Tower prize on every clear, from a pool of PP Up, PP Max,
  Nugget, Big Pearl and Star Piece.
- Gym Leader rematches give a random reward.
- Playtest: 16 checks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
